# Local development (gitignored as `.env.local`). Root `bun run dev` / `dev:api` load this via
# `--env-file` so variables reach the API (plain `bun --filter` does not load root .env files).
# Copy: cp .env.local.example .env.local

# SQLite file for the API. Default when unset: ./sampledb_dev.sqlite at repo root (empty dev DB).
# Relative paths are resolved from the monorepo root (not packages/api), including when using `bun dev`.
# Uncomment to use your production snapshot or another DB file:
# DATABASE_PATH=./sampledb_database.sqlite
